specs/hal-engine-npm-release/spec.md:288:- `createServer` forwards `onConnect` into the `deps` object the connection handler receives, which is the omission that made the hook dead ([validated by: forwards onConnect to the connection handler](../../src/transport/createServer.test.ts#L41)).
